28. Frontend stack: Cake templates + elements vs API + separate SPA vs HTMX partials.
    - Hint: `composer.json` + `package.json`; `ls templates/`, front-end asset dirs.
29. Template composition: elements vs cells vs View classes vs layouts-only.
    - Hint: `ls templates/element src/View/Cell`; grep `$this->element(`, `$this->cell(`.
{% if assist.hasPackage('zunnu/cake-htmx') %}
30. HTMX: partial swaps vs full-page responses; where HTMX attributes live.
    - Hint: grep `hx-`, `Htmx` in `templates/` and controllers.
{% endif %}
{% if assist.hasPackage('friendsofcake/bootstrap-ui') %}
31. UI kit (Bootstrap UI): BootstrapUI helpers/widgets vs custom Form helpers vs another library.
    - Hint: grep `BootstrapUI`, `Form->` patterns in templates.
{% endif %}
32. Localization: `__()` / `__d()` keys vs hard-coded strings in templates/controllers.
    - Hint: `ls resources/locales`; grep `__('`, `__d(` density.

## G. Database & migrations

33. Foreign keys: `addForeignKey` / constrained columns vs application-only integrity.
    - Hint: grep `foreignKey`, `addForeignKey` in `config/Migrations`.
34. `down()` methods: real reverse logic vs omitted / one-way migrations.
    - Hint: grep `function down` vs the migration count.
35. Enum storage: DB enum/string columns vs PHP-backed enums on entities.
    - Hint: grep enum-like columns in migrations vs `enum` in `src/`.
36. Transactions: `Connection::transactional()` vs manual begin/commit/rollback.
    - Hint: grep `transactional(`, `begin(`, `commit(` in `src/`.
37. Idempotent writes: `updateOrCreate`-style finders vs find-then-save.
    - Hint: grep `findOrCreate`, `updateAll`, save patterns in Tables/Services.

## H. Testing

38. Framework: Pest (`it()` / `test()` / `expect()`) vs PHPUnit classes.
    - Hint: `ls tests/Pest.php`; grep `it(` / `test(` vs `extends TestCase`.
39. DB reset: fixtures vs migrations-in-tests vs truncated schemas.
    - Hint: grep `$fixtures`, `Fixture`, schema helpers in `tests/`.
40. Fixtures: Cake fixtures vs factories vs manual inserts.
    - Hint: grep `Factory`, `$this->getTableLocator`, fixture class names in `tests/`.
41. Collaborator isolation: Mockery / Pest mocks vs real integration for app classes.
    - Hint: grep -- `Mockery::`, `->mock(`, `->spy(` in `tests/`.
42. Endpoint assertions: integration `get`/`post` + assertResponse* vs pure unit.
    - Hint: grep `assertResponse`, `get(`, `post(` in feature/integration tests.

## I. Responses & APIs

43. Response shape: JsonView / serialized entities vs manual `withType('application/json')` bodies vs HTML-only.
    - Hint: grep `JsonView`, `viewBuilder()->setClassName`, `withType(` in controllers.
44. Pagination: `paginate()` vs manual limit/offset vs cursor helpers.
    - Hint: grep `paginate(`, `setPaging` in controllers.
45. Redirects/URLs: named routes vs array URLs vs string paths.
    - Hint: grep `['_name'`, `Router::url`, `redirect([` in controllers and templates.

## J. Strings, collections & dates

46. Iteration idiom: Cake `Collection` / `collection()` pipelines vs `array_map` / `foreach`.
    - Hint: grep -- `collection(`, `->map(` vs `array_map`, `foreach` density in `src/`.
47. String API: Cake `Text` / `h()` vs native string funcs.
    - Hint: grep `Text::`, `h(` vs native string funcs.
48. Dates: FrozenTime / Chronos helpers vs `DateTimeImmutable` vs strings.
    - Hint: grep `FrozenTime`, `DateTimeImmutable`, `Chronos` in `src/`.

---

Genuine forks only: every row survived the "no tool can decide this, and it isn't the default" filter. Give each applicable dimension exactly one verdict: pattern, conflict, default, no-signal, tooling-owned, or already-recorded. The architecture rows are where the highest-value rules come from.
